title: Loading Source JSON
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

The source area accepts JSON three ways: typed/pasted, file-picked, or drag-dropped.  All three land the text in the same textarea, which the engine then parses on ''Convert''.  A status line under the box tells you at once whether what you have is valid JSON.

